        "date": "2026-11-12T10:49:25Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(post): bound the EDM condition table, every refusal by id and key\n\nReview of PR #560:\n- gap > 0; on a wire, gap < the wire's radius when both are stated;\n- wire_diameter and undersize in (0, 1] mm, judged after unit scaling;\n- the parse takes the declared kind: undersize refuses on a wire and\n  wire_diameter on a sinker;\n- a condition's wire must be one of the machine's edm.wire_diameters\n  (within 0.001 mm) when it states any;\n- ids: no surrounding spaces, numeric ids whole numbers only, unique\n  ignoring case and leading zeros;\n- an unknown condition key refuses by name; lengths finite after scaling;\n- one rule function (condition_refusal) serves the reader and is_sane;\n- conditions[] documented in assets/machines/AGENTS.md; the parser tests\n  move to crates/post/src/machine/edm_conditions_tests.rs (the app suite\n  keeps the project round trip).\n\nRefs #531\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
